<h1>📄 Printable</h1><p class="s">Print-ready PDFs and smart question banks. Everything runs in your browser — nothing is uploaded.</p>

<div id="home" class="view show in"><div class="big" tabindex="0" role="button" data-go="v1"><div class="ic">🖨️</div><b>Make one PDF printable</b><span>Pages per sheet, highlight, page numbers, odd/even split, plus an optional question bank.</span></div>
<div class="big" tabindex="0" role="button" data-go="v2"><div class="ic">🧠</div><b>Question bank from many PDFs</b><span>Drop several files and get one shuffled bank of the high-yield essay questions only.</span></div>
