<div class="card" style="padding:10px 14px"><label class="h" style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="all" style="width:20px;height:20px;accent-color:var(--ac)">Select all tools</label></div>
<div class="card tool" id="t3"><label class="h"><input type="checkbox" id="c3">Auto Question Bank (offline) + Merge</label>
<div class="opts" style="display:block">
<small>Reads every slide/page, ignores lecture numbers, page numbers, teacher names and repeated headers, skips repeated and figure-only slides, and writes 1-3 essay questions per topic with a model-answer key and page references. Works without internet or AI.</small>
<div class="row"><label>Position&nbsp;<select id="mpos"><option value="after">Append after original</option><option value="before">Put before original</option></select></label></div>
<div class="row"><button class="g" id="qbb">Or use my own question-bank PDF</button><input id="qb" type="file" accept="application/pdf" hidden><small id="qbn">auto-generate (default)</small></div>
</div></div>

<div class="card tool" id="t4"><label class="h"><input type="checkbox" id="c4">Background highlight + thin borders</label>
<div class="opts"><label>Colour<input type="color" id="hc" value="#ffe066"></label>
<label>Height (% of page)<input type="number" id="hh" value="100" min="1" max="100"></label>
<label>Opacity (%)<input type="number" id="ho" value="30" min="5" max="100"></label>
